{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Koblenz today, weary but in good spirits. The journey from Kassel was a study in discomfort. I sat facing backward, which gave me a peculiar view of the Lahn winding behind us, while a young student from Göttingen clung to the seat behind me with the tenacity of a barnacle. We were six souls packed into that box, sweating through our coats.\n\nI find myself thinking of our quiet evenings in Berlin. There is a strange freedom in being alone on the road, yet I miss your voice and the simple order of our home. The Rhine here is magnificent, though the heat is oppressive. I have taken a room above the river. I hope the boys are behaving themselves and that you are not too tired from the household duties. I shall write again tomorrow.\n\nYours ever,\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795080181,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":182,"prompt_tokens":941,"total_tokens":1123,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-QHiThLLky0yTw47SADBJ3jedbUC5bQqK","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":941,"prompt_ms":950.716,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0103251859723699,"prompt_per_second":989.7803339798636,"predicted_n":182,"predicted_ms":4314.781,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.83856906077348,"predicted_per_second":41.948826603250545}}